  "scope": "macOS Release. Datafriend uses async flush; flutter is in-memory screen-owned setState, no database. Checkbox callbacks for toggle; direct triple edits or State methods for title/order. Flutter recomputes filtering, sorting and completion count during build. Bulk uses the previous full-list query; rows uses order-only list plus mounted row queries. Counter query shared by both. 30 measured edits after 5 warmups by default, 250 ms pause after each frame. Actual edited frame build/raster matched by engine frame number. Bulk and rows have identical visual layout. App builder callbacks counted; per-action row rebuild scope checked. No network; seed, lookup, checks and close/reopen outside timers.",
